  "notes": [
    "The security scheme is declared at #/components/securitySchemes/Token-based-authorization as an apiKey carried in the request header named 'Authorization'. The document declares a global 'security' requirement of [{\"Token-based-authorization\": []}]; acquireToken overrides it with an empty 'security' array and is therefore the only unauthenticated operation in this contract.",
